sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / CI Trigger
    participant UI as Next.js Dashboard
    participant API as Express API Server
    participant Redis as Redis BullMQ Broker
    participant Worker as BullMQ Pipeline Worker
    participant Sandbox as Docker Engine
    participant SSE as SSE Streamer

    Dev->>UI: Dispatch Self-Heal Pipeline
    UI->>API: POST /api/pipeline/dispatch
    API->>Redis: pipelineQueue.add("run-pipeline", payload)
    API-->>UI: Return runId & initiate SSE subscription
    
    UI->>API: GET /api/pipeline/stream/:runId
    API->>SSE: Open Server-Sent Events stream
    
    Redis->>Worker: Job dequeued for processing
    Worker->>SSE: emitPipelineLog("Running Critic Agent...")
    SSE-->>UI: Real-time telemetry log chunk
    
    Worker->>Sandbox: Stage container execution (node/python/maven)
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Isolated test suite verification
    Sandbox-->>Worker: Exit status code 0 (Pass)
    
    Worker->>SSE: emitPipelineLog("Test suite PASSED in Docker sandbox!")
    Worker->>SSE: emitEvent("agent_end", { sandbox: completed })
    SSE-->>UI: Display verified status badge & synthesized patch
